LUMA SUMMARY:
Protocol/parser debugging. After the full source is shared through the wrong channel and the relay breaks, the crew identifies parser/token problems caused by protocol markers appearing in places the relay interprets structurally. The session moves toward separating message framing from ordinary content and toward byte-level stability checks.
